    "<id>-portrait.png and <id>-landscape.png next to this file, and its tile shows",
    "<id>-thumb.webp, a small emoji-like picture (override any of them with",
    "\"images\": {\"portrait\": \"…\", \"landscape\": \"…\", \"thumb\": \"…\"}, and the",
    "thumbnail's subject with \"thumbPrompt\"). The pages are colored pages, made",
    "with the same prompt as Create; set \"style\": \"lineArt\" for black-and-white ones.",
    "A page whose pictures are missing still shows, and tapping it asks the generator",
    "instead. See web/README.md."
